error[E4104]: cannot use `buffer.len` while it is mutably borrowed
  --> tests/borrows/fail/E4104_async_retained_buffer.tarn:22:11
   |
21 |     computation := fill(&execution, &mut buffer)
   |                                     ----------- mutable borrow of `buffer` starts here
22 |     print(buffer.len)
   |           ^^^^^^^^^^ used here
23 |     var op = net.Operation.new(&execution, computation)
   |                                            ----------- the borrow is still used here
   |
   = note: a borrow lasts until the last use of the reference that holds it

